Generic code descriptions: Gershy13/dtc-lookup
Revision: a1f02ec1e81efe101c051221bbf5adc6d33e7585
Source: src/manufacturers/generic.cpp
https://github.com/Gershy13/dtc-lookup

Only powertrain and selected network definitions are included. The unverified
body/chassis entries and U0120 were omitted. Incorrect throttle-direction and
network-module descriptions were corrected with paraphrases checked against:
https://www.hella.com/hotsecdocs/OBDII/dtc_db/codelists/en_p-codes.htm
https://www.hella.com/hotsecdocs/OBDII/dtc_db/codelists/en_u-codes.htm

P1E00 is a separately paraphrased GM definition:
https://techlink.mynetworkcontent.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/GM_TechLink_14_Mid-July_2017.pdf

